Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Remove SoundCloud, media.ccc.de, PeerTube and Bandcamp
 services

Keep only YouTube (0), BiliBili (5) and NicoNico (6), preserving the
original service ids so persisted data stays valid. Lookups must use
NewPipe.getService(int) (searches by id) instead of indexing
ServiceList.all().
